      "notes": [
        "RGB565 and 8-bit DVP use separate native IO-MUX buses (Espressif hardware guide, tables 11 and 12).",
        "HS OTG is on dedicated pads 44/45. GPIO33/34 are used by RGB after disabling their reset USB-Serial/JTAG function.",
        "GPIO36 is both LCD red MSB and flash-voltage strap. R403 pulls it high for the 3.3 V NOR at reset.",
        "GPIO37 and GPIO60 use the existing pulled-up SD select nets. GPIO61 low plus GPIO60 high selects joint download.",
        "Use I2S0 for two microphone data lines and I2S1 for the full-duplex codec. SPI mode keeps GPIO20..25 at 3.3 V.",
        "R3A RP2350B pin assignments are preserved. Radio is integrated and the former C6 is removed."
      ]
