      "notes": [
        "C401-C404 sit at U1 pads 11, 43, 54 and 64, respectively. C405 and C406 sit at VDDA1, C407 and C408 at VDDA2.",
        "L401 is 2 nH, 35 milliohms max and 2 A rated at 25 C. Keep C410 close to VDDA3/4 and scope the local rail under radio load.",
        "C413/C414 at U1 pad 30 and C415/C416 at pad 34 bypass the internal PSRAM LDO. C417 bypasses its output at pad 35.",
        "Provide at least 600 mA at the processor 3.3 V supply. Check combined radio, display, LEDs and audio load on the battery converter."
      ]
